-# locals: errors (Array) — the validation messages from a refused Save; empty
-# when the last Save was not refused.
-#
-# The container renders whether or not there are errors, because the Validate
-# turbo_stream replaces this node to clear a stale refusal — Turbo needs the
-# target to be on the page to find it.
#save_refusal
  - if errors.present?
    .alert.alert-danger{role: "alert"}
      %h5.alert-heading Not saved — this XML is not valid
      %p.mb-2 Your changes are still in the editor below. Correct the problem and save again.
      %ul.mb-0
        - errors.each do |err|
          %li= err.to_s
